<description>&lt;p&gt;The Venezuelan army bombed an ELN guerrilla camp in Apure, killing at least 19 rebels. A drone strike hit an ELN drug depot nearby, causing at least 20 deaths. Oliver Blanco met with a U.S. official in Washington to discuss election preparations while U.S. officials negotiate a possible long term military presence in Venezuela. President Trump claimed a one day operation could capture Maduro and warned of possible U.S. action against Cuba, also stating Venezuelan oil revenues far exceed Iran war costs. The UCDP counted 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/03/world/americas/us-venezuela-strike-eln-drug-trafficking.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNWk8xbVpKVVo3aDJVZjZSa2pBOXB3SnNmam5iYlltcC01aWh2Z01oNEZRNmxMcTlsbkhZV2hMc1h0NzFiLXQyNWlxNTZIZDYxQ01sYTF2TTB5X0lsMGRIVVR1Ym9SODVaOXZQc1VGeXBPYk1GaUU5NDUzMVNERWkwa0JTX1haSmMyQWFN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTE9fM3YwU0ZhOExHSGhDTXNhZGUxN3ZlR29YUzVVVzhLNFRiUjJaQkxqRWl3blo5YnJRLUdWdHlsODdUVVY3T1Z6a0dkNEFEeEZ1OHRzZ3k2emhwSWZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQQmlFbS1OcmRzM29OLTkxdG9QM2NERVIyTGtiTkVyUHI5alV5eGtqTTVFQXRQRXhqUjlvUVhtZW1DRVdCRjlZOXM1RktpYndQQUNEOEZVbENoeUE3aDlaZzZFSzk2SjIwMWlTTDluTHlXQWkyTmxJOTdTR3l1aTF1R1pB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxNdEYyRC1zdWVzRGJ2MmhjeXBSaTdoMUQwZkNEQ25Kckw3TFpoMlNUamFUQmZXakVsMGF2Tnc0ME1ERG9HNUxoVjBXeE5IUURBbEw2SXhzNEE2QlhQZ1NzcXhxQUVkVHVCT1ExZlZJX2NrcFg2aTZ4VG5GdWhjT05XcE5TWUM2LVR5dkNzOXNFR2E?oc=5&quot;&gt;CNET&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss